<main class="roadmap-page">
  <header class="roadmap-hero"><div><p class="roadmap-eyebrow">ACC future vision</p><h1>Building the next African trade network</h1><p>Explore the phases, capabilities, and experiments guiding ACC from a trusted platform into continental infrastructure.</p></div><a class="roadmap-button roadmap-button--light" href="/admin/roadmap">Roadmap governance</a></header>
  <% if (message) { %><div class="roadmap-alert"><%= message %></div><% } %>
  <section class="roadmap-phases"><% phases.forEach((phase) => { %><article class="roadmap-phase roadmap-phase--<%= phase.status %>"><span class="roadmap-phase__number"><%= phase.sequence_number %></span><div><p><%= phase.status %></p><h2><%= phase.name %></h2><span><%= phase.description %></span></div></article><% }) %></section>
  <section class="roadmap-section"><div class="roadmap-section__heading"><div><p class="roadmap-kicker">What is taking shape</p><h2>Feature roadmap</h2></div><span><%= features.length %> visible initiatives</span></div><div class="roadmap-feature-grid"><% features.forEach((feature) => { %><article class="roadmap-feature"><div class="roadmap-feature__meta"><span><%= feature.phase_name || 'Future phase' %></span><strong><%= feature.priority %></strong></div><h3><%= feature.title %></h3><p><%= feature.description %></p><footer><span class="roadmap-status roadmap-status--<%= feature.status %>"><%= feature.status.replace(/_/g, ' ') %></span><span><%= feature.target_quarter || 'Timing to be confirmed' %></span></footer></article><% }) %><% if (!features.length) { %><p>No public initiatives have been published yet.</p><% } %></div></section>
  <section class="roadmap-split"><div class="roadmap-section"><div class="roadmap-section__heading"><div><p class="roadmap-kicker">North star</p><h2>Strategic goals</h2></div></div><div class="roadmap-list"><% goals.forEach((goal) => { %><div><strong><%= goal.title %></strong><span><%= goal.description %></span><small><%= goal.goal_area %><%= goal.metric_name ? ' · ' + goal.metric_name + ': ' + goal.target_value : '' %></small></div><% }) %><% if (!goals.length) { %><p>Strategic goals will appear here as they are approved.</p><% } %></div></div><div class="roadmap-section"><div class="roadmap-section__heading"><div><p class="roadmap-kicker">Experimentation</p><h2>Innovation signals</h2></div></div><div class="roadmap-list"><% innovations.slice(0, 6).forEach((item) => { %><div><strong><%= item.title %></strong><span><%= item.description %></span><small><%= item.category %> · <%= item.status %></small></div><% }) %><% if (!innovations.length) { %><p>Innovation initiatives will appear here.</p><% } %></div></div></section>
  <section class="roadmap-feedback"><div><p class="roadmap-kicker">Shape what comes next</p><h2>Share roadmap feedback</h2><p>Stakeholder demand is one input into quarterly roadmap reviews. Your message is stored for product decisions.</p></div><form class="roadmap-form" method="post" action="/roadmap/feedback"><label>Name<input name="stakeholderName" maxlength="160"></label><label>Email<input name="stakeholderEmail" type="email" maxlength="180"></label><label>Feature ID <span class="roadmap-muted">optional</span><input name="featureId" type="number" min="1"></label><label>Rating<select name="rating"><option value="">Choose</option><option>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option><option>5</option></select></label><label class="roadmap-form__wide">Feedback<textarea name="message" rows="4" required maxlength="3000" placeholder="What should ACC prioritize next?"></textarea></label><button class="roadmap-button" type="submit">Submit feedback</button></form></section>
</main>
